367	    /**
368	     Add an enforced attribute to a tag. An enforced attribute will always be added to the element. If the element
369	     already has the attribute set, it will be overridden with this value.
370	     <p>
371	     E.g.: <code>addEnforcedAttribute("a", "rel", "nofollow")</code> will make all <code>a</code> tags output as
372	     <code>&lt;a href="..." rel="nofollow"&gt;</code>
